  "feed_composition": {
    "note": "The substrate mix varies per phase (a load change may also change which substrates are fed) and differs per series. To keep the modes invariant to the mix, the load is steered as an organic (degradable-COD) load: for each phase the volumetric flows are scaled so the COD load equals the target, since the substrates differ ~11x in COD per m3 (slurry weakest, maize strongest). feed_true holds the actual volumetric flows [m3/d].",
